  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO/International NGO Safety Organisation 2024-2025 - INSO/International NGO Safety Organisation HUM core support 2024-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INSO/International NGO Safety Organisation 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO&apos;s overall objectives are:
1. The relief and development of people in need anywhere in the world who are the victims of conflict, natural disaster, insecurity or crisis;
2. The welfare and safety of people involved in the provision of humanitarian and development aid anywhere in the world.
These goals will be achieved by:
1. Providing dedicated safety &amp; security services to organisations working to achieve the relief and development of people in need.
2. Promoting and facilitating a wider understanding of conflict and its impact on humanitarian and development safety.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO&apos;s overall objectives are:
1.	The relief and development of people in need anywhere in the world who are the victims of conflict, natural disaster, insecurity or crisis; 
2.	The welfare and safety of people involved in the provision of humanitarian and development aid anywhere in the world. 
These goals will be achieved by:
1.	Providing dedicated safety &amp; security services to organisations working to achieve the relief and development of people in need. 
2.	Promoting and facilitating a wider understanding of conflict and its impact on humanitarian and development safety.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INSO:s &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning &#xe4;r att:
1. Lindra n&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor som drabbas av konflikter, naturkatastrofer eller andra krissituationer.
2. S&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla bist&#xe5;ndsarbetares v&#xe4;lbefinnande och s&#xe4;kerhet.
Dessa m&#xe5;l &#xe4;mnas uppn&#xe5;s genom att:
1. Tillhandah&#xe5;lla s&#xe4;kerhetstj&#xe4;nster till humanit&#xe4;ra organisationer som arbetar f&#xf6;r
att lindra n&#xf6;d och r&#xe4;dda liv.
2. Fr&#xe4;mja och underl&#xe4;tta en bredare f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else av konflikter och dess inverkan
p&#xe5; humanit&#xe4;r s&#xe4;kerhet och global, regional och lokal utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
